# vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/tool_budget.py

`ToolCallBudget`, a deepagents middleware that caps how many times one session may call a named (metered) set of tools, for example the graph tools. Over the cap, a call is refused with an error tool result without running, a warning is printed once per counter, and on the next model call the metered tools are removed from the offered tool list with a one-time notice. An out-of-loop form (`refusal_for`) serves the sdk, openai and cli routes.

Source: `vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/tool_budget.py` (lines 1-192)
Executor: code
